{"articleNo":"128295","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=128295&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2015 한민족청년과학도포럼(Young Generation Forum) 지원신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2015.05.01","hit":"2662","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">한국과학기술단체총연합회에서 오는 6.29.(월)부터 7. 2.(목)까지 미국을 비롯한 독일, 영국, 중국, 러시아 등지의 해외동포 청년과학기술자 75명과 한국 청년과학기술자 45명 등 총 120명이 참가한 가운데 \"2015 한민족청년과학도포럼\"을 개최할 계획입니다. </span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\">&nbsp;</p></span><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">1. 행사명 : 2015 한민족청년과학도포럼(YGF)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2. 기&nbsp;&nbsp; 간 : 2015.06.29.(월) ~ 7. 2.(목)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">3. 장&nbsp;&nbsp; 소 : 서울 리버사이드호텔 및 한국과학기술회관</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">4. 참가대상 : 과학기술관련 전공 학부 3, 4학년생 및 석/박사과정(영어로 의사소통 가능)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">5. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">제출서류</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; </span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">- </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">참가신청서 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">과총 국제협력 통합 홈페이지</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(www.ultari.org)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">에서 회원가입 및 </span><br><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; YGF </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">페이지에서 참가신청 등록</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">신청자 본인이 작성</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">- </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">영어 능력을 측정 할 수 있는 성적</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(TOEIC, TOEFL, TEPS </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">등</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">)(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">외국인 유학생 제외</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">※ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">사회적 약자</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">고아</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">편부모</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">입양자 등</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">의 경우 우대</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">자기소개란 첫부분에 기재</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">※ 외국인 유학생과 동반신청시 우대(자기소개란 첫부분에 외국인유학생 성명등 추천내용표기)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; -&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">참가신청서 제출처 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">모든 제출서류는 홈페이지 등록</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; - 제출기한 : 2015. 5. 20.(수)</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><s